Axel trainer spinner allows athletes to train vestibular system.
Great for sports such Figure skating, Ballet, Gymnastics and any other sports or activities that requiers high speed rotations

Unique simulator/app features:
• Display of current speed, maximum limit;
• The "Auto-trainer" function The simulator automatically increases the speed and speed according to a given program, optionally, changing the direction of movement;
• Notification of reaching the set speed to check training time;
• Detection of the speed changes during training; 
• Notification of reaching goal for a set number of revolutions;
• Graph of the current speed to check acceleration during twisting;
• Auto start - the beginning of rotation at a set speed with a sharp turn of the disk;
• Auto break - stopping rotation when jumping from the simulator;
• Setting the dynamics of rotation of the simulator: acceleration, response, speed.


Attention: classes should be carried out only under the supervision and control of an experienced instructor or Adult 

